BT /F1 10 Tf 56 664 Td (During the March 12, 2026 outage, the notifications service experienced a significant backlog) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 650 Td (of merchant webhooks. Payment events queued up faster than the notification workers could) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 636 Td (process them. The Merchant Experience team scaled the notification worker fleet in response,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 622 Td (clearing the backlog within approximately 90 minutes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 600 Td (Impact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 580 Td (A total of 26,900 webhooks were delayed during and after the outage. Merchants experienced) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 566 Td (delayed notifications about payment events, which affected their ability to reconcile) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 552 Td (transactions and update order statuses in real time. The backlog persisted until worker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 538 Td (capacity was increased.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 516 Td (Timeline) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 496 Td (- 15:05 UTC: Notification workers scaled up via CHG-1045) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 476 Td (- 16:30 UTC: Webhook backlog cleared) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 456 Td (For details on the broader outage context, see INC-301.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 434 Td (Root Cause) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 414 Td (The notifications service depends on the payments-api and ledger services to emit payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 400 Td (events. When these services experienced issues during the March 12 outage, payment events) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 386 Td (continued to be generated but the notification workers could not keep pace with the queue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 372 Td (depth. The worker fleet size was insufficient to handle the event volume during recovery.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 350 Td (Resolution) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 330 Td (Hannah Kim and the Merchant Experience team executed CHG-1045 to scale the notification workers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 316 Td (from 8 to 24 instances at 15:05 UTC. This increase in capacity allowed the service to process) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 302 Td (the accumulated webhooks. The backlog was fully cleared by 16:30 UTC.) Tj ET
